<title>HONG KONG: Beauforte interim net down 23.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Beauforte interim net down 23.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   80.0     vs 105.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    25.0     vs 25.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.0 gain vs 13.2 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    23.4     vs 30.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		     33.6     vs 32.3</p>
<p>    Company name		 Beauforte Investors Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 1-4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Beauforte is an investment holding company with subsidiaries engaged in shipowning, property and investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of certain long term investments.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
